Project Images

This folder contains images and visual references of the DIY USB Flight Simulator Controller project.

Contents

The images in this folder may include:

- Project Photos: Pictures of the completed flight simulator controller.
- Wiring Diagrams: Visual references showing the connections between the Arduino Pro Micro, potentiometers, toggle switches, and activation button.
- 3D Model Images: Pictures showing the design and appearance of the 3D-printed enclosure.
- Assembly Photos: Images documenting the construction and assembly process.

Purpose

These images help explain the hardware design, wiring, enclosure, and development process of the project.

They provide a visual reference for anyone interested in understanding or recreating the controller.

---

Project: DIY USB Flight Simulator Controller
Microcontroller: Arduino Pro Micro (ATmega32U4)
